# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. The boxes they ARRIVE at: what the tabs report.
#
# Twenty-eight, which is fourteen on the 526 grid (classic548 and the two
# remount lanes) and fourteen on the 528 grid (classic161). Every one is
# 33x36 -- the size the lane states for every stone it has -- and each is the
# box the lane's own `sidetab_NN` role resolves to, to the pixel. That
# equality is the acceptance this change was written against, and it is
# checkable from the same log: `ROLE_WIDGET role=sidetab_NN box=...` against
# `OWNED_WIDGET key=face.NN box=...`.
only-after  abs=526,168 33x36 wh= = and at the box its own tab reports, which is where the hollow is cut now
only-after  abs=560,168 33x36 wh= = and at the box its own tab reports, which is where the hollow is cut now
