# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. The same move, said about each owned control.
#
# Forty-two keys: fourteen hit boxes, fourteen faces and fourteen icons. Every
# one of them MOVES -- none is added, none is dropped, and no count changes --
# which is what distinguishes this from a port that gained or lost furniture.
#
# tab.03 and icon.03 are in the list because they move on 161, whose grid
# starts at 528; on 548 they are the one stone the two grids happened to agree
# about. A declaration that never fired anywhere would be reported stale, so
# these two are here on the strength of the lane that needs them.
owned-move face.00 = the stone takes its box from its own tab instead of from the art strip, and its picture is re-cut to it
